      en: ["MSA was founded with the support of Soviet technology in the 1960s.", "The complex includes its own foundry and forge for large components.", "The company has constructed bridges for the national railway network.", "The factories employ several thousand specialized engineers and workers.", "MSA produces pressure vessels weighing up to 500 tons.", "The company exports its products to over 20 countries worldwide."],
